{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0.4,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"event":"GAoEvent","eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"bubble\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara002_2\": \"04\"\r    }\r  }\r}"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿……看来这里藏着不少好东西啊。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_4","text":"呃……好东西是指？"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]你看不到吗？那边草堆上的破木头，被丢在这的锈剑和护甲碎片，还有干草堆和碎石块……这些都是宝藏啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]在野外，但凡能派上用场的都是无价之宝，有时候想要还没有呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]毕竟想在荒野中生存，也不能全靠身体和意志，还得靠充足的食物和安稳的住所。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]当时失忆的我流落到这片草原，能活下来，靠的就是我这手拾荒的本事。这些“垃圾”不仅让我填饱肚子，能盖出最早的营地来，也全都靠它们。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_9","text":"米托拉……"},{"tag":"tag_9","text":"那一定……很辛苦吧。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]嘿嘿，那当然。现在想起来都还心有余悸呢。不过苦日子已经都过去了，跟你说说也无妨。{myName}想要听听吗？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_11","text":"快讲讲！"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]我刚来到草原的那时候，手里也没件武器，到处都是危机四伏。别看这儿天蓝草绿的，但能吃的东西少得可怜，偶尔能找到个野果就不错了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"event":"GAoEvent","eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"bubble\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara002_2\": \"06\"\r    }\r  }\r}"},"key":"event"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]赤手空拳对上那些角布林和大角猪，根本就是送命，所以我只能躲着它们，根本没法跟它们抢食吃。别提多窝囊了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我饿了三天，就想着不能再这么下去，我会死的。我要在草原上活下去。所以我盯上了那些浑身是肉的大角猪。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你看那些破木头和布片好像没啥用，但组合起来就是一个陷阱。我挖了一个坑，然后捡了些尖尖的木棒埋了进去，接着用布和杂草盖上。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]接着就是引猪入坑了。我在路口放了几堆杂草，等角猪走进陷阱区域的时候我就用燧石点上火，有一头就正正好好掉到陷阱里面去了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那天晚上我可算开了荤。这就是我在草原吃的第一个大餐！当晚我肚子都撑大了一整圈呢。我靠这些“垃圾”头一次尝到了成功的滋味！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_18","text":"米托拉太强了！"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2f","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]嘿嘿……那是当然。还不止这些故事哦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我在路上碰到了许多……被魔物杀死的人。有的是商人、平民，有的是荒野客，还有契约者。不知道为什么，我……我不太喜欢看到人就这么死掉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]所以我见到遗体，都会去埋葬掉，让他们入土为安。当然，他们身上的那些遗物，我就作为报酬顺手收下了。毕竟我也需要用来生存的物资嘛。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我手里的武器、衣服、斧头、铲子，还有写字的笔和日记本，都是这么来的。这么一说，没有那些死去的人们，也没有还活着的我。[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_23","text":"“索命凶猫”就是这么来的吧。"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]是啊……虽然我这不算什么善举，但也不算做了什么坏事吧。莫名其妙被冠上了这种名号，也挺让人头疼的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不过我现在也无所谓啦。反正这世上只要有你理解我就行。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不说这些了，我们快把这些烂木头都拿回去吧，能来搭把手吗？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_27","text":"不过，既然有我了……"},{"tag":"tag_27","text":"需要木头直接砍树不就行了……"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]嘿，我们可是出来拾荒的，砍树像什么话！我当初可就是凭着这些烂木头建家的，可不能忘本了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]这就叫什么，驿站那帮人总在说的——对，仪式感，仪式感！来吧，我们两个人一起肯定快多啦！就算用不上，咱们就把这些东西全卖给毛耳朵！[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"tag":"tag_30","text":"（苦笑着跟上米托拉。）"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]就让我们两人一起，把从草原上没人要的宝藏都收进包包里吧！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"fore","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"fore","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":340,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[show]（于是，和米托拉在草原上捡了一天的“垃圾”。米托拉看起来非常开心。）[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"fore","noOut":false,"x":-500,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"bgblack","addImg":"","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"米托拉-我在草原捡垃圾-进入战役","script":"fav_hero_002_1_1"}